<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Santos half yr net up to A$88.6 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Santos half yr net up to A$88.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    152.0 vs  87.8</p>
<p>    Net					88.6 vs  18.50</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     11.0 vs  11.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Santos Ltd is an oil and gas producer.  </p>
<p>    Sales				  335.4 vs 338.0</p>
<p>    Other income			  40.1 vs  33.9</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   16.5 vs   3.4</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			 nil vs  nil</p>
<p>Dividend is fully franked.</p>
<p>Pay date Nov 15</p>
<p>Reg date Oct 25</p>
<p>    Tax				     63.4 vs  69.3</p>
<p>    Interest				24.1 vs  23.4</p>
<p>    Depreciation			 100.5 vs 104.8</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
